  "definition": "Commingling of Funds Prohibited",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-07-10",
  "historyNote": "#5787, eff 2-14-94; ss by #7023, eff 7-1-99; ss by #7318, eff 8-1-00, EXPIRED: 8-1-08 New. #9510, eff 7-10-09; ss by #12228, eff 7-10-17",
